# public/storage is NOT ignored, and there is no `storage:link` symlink. The
# `public` disk is rooted at public_path('storage'), so uploads and seeded
# pictures land straight in the document root. Shared hosting cannot be relied
# on to create a symlink, and a checked-out junction only shadows it. These
# images ARE tracked — they are site content, not build output.

